        "official_en_sha256": "5428c573a9be8638aab5ea282cbce9d6393c1775100e058342d900fae5838a55"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これは一時しのぎです。\r\nまたすぐに穢れは広がると思います。",
        "official_en": "I’m afraid this only serves as a temporary solution. Given time, the corruption will spread again.",
        "real_en": "This is only temporary. I think the corruption will spread again soon."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
