        "official_en_sha256": "a2e0023f4e073b5fedc665660d81ef678af71b0938dd6c8b953f285025d383ce"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "こんな事態がくるとは思っていませんでしたが、\r\n私はやるべきことをやるだけです。",
        "official_en": "Although I did not expect us to be placed in such circumstances, I shall do what needs to be done.",
        "real_en": "I never thought things would come to this, but I’ll simply do what I must."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
