        "official_en": "I’ve studied the ways of the Water Maiden from an early age, and it is <text style=\"italic\">I</> who have inherited the mantle of Maiden from Mother.",
        "real_en": "I’ve studied to become a Maiden since I was little, and my mother entrusted that duty to me."
